{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>a momentum-driven platforming adventure!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a lost firefly searching for their family, blazing a trail through obstacles, uncovering secrets, and building speed to soar farther than you ever imagined</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/0d8d60e9f5e7d6c61ca22d39d2c2162c.poster.avif?t=1758123956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/0d8d60e9f5e7d6c61ca22d39d2c2162c.webm?t=1758123956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/0d8d60e9f5e7d6c61ca22d39d2c2162c.mp4?t=1758123956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FireFly</strong> is a\u00a0momentum-driven\u00a0platforming collect-a-thon where mastering movement is the key to exploring vibrant, open maps.\u00a0Leap, slide, swing, and launch yourself\u00a0across hand-crafted environments, discovering shortcuts and hidden alcoves as your skill and search for adventure grow</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Flyph</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/67c22b57d705234eca31ea90f7bfe12f.poster.avif?t=1758123956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/67c22b57d705234eca31ea90f7bfe12f.webm?t=1758123956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/67c22b57d705234eca31ea90f7bfe12f.mp4?t=1758123956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flyph is a small, <strong>squishy</strong> firefly who has lost their parents. After the accident that separated them, they\u00a0can no longer fly. Now, they must learn to navigate the world on foot, leaping, climbing, and darting through sprawling paths while they navigate the strange new world of <strong><i>the\u00a0ground.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soar with GLOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/e179e716f9be8f285383885825048724.poster.avif?t=1758123956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/e179e716f9be8f285383885825048724.webm?t=1758123956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/e179e716f9be8f285383885825048724.mp4?t=1758123956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster Flyph moves, the brighter they <strong>glow</strong>, and once they start <strong>glowing</strong>, they start moving even faster! Build up momentum to trigger blazing bursts of speed, chaining movement into electrifying displays of skill and agility!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore <strong>Three+</strong> Open Maps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/13ccc70926b8c93b6a0227da51ffc35d.poster.avif?t=1758123956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/13ccc70926b8c93b6a0227da51ffc35d.webm?t=1758123956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/13ccc70926b8c93b6a0227da51ffc35d.mp4?t=1758123956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From perilous cliffs to the flooded depths of mysterious caverns, Flyph scours the world for any sign of their family, swinging from ropes, wall-jumping past hazards, uncovering secret paths, mysterious friends, and the occasional surprise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/2f0727d36fe87020613906c342bf0f46.poster.avif?t=1758123956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/2f0727d36fe87020613906c342bf0f46.webm?t=1758123956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/extras/2f0727d36fe87020613906c342bf0f46.mp4?t=1758123956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002900?t=1758123956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/55eb4bd6074a54bb5f5846975fd740e2bcb676e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758123956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/7a8aa2cc4274120447bf2f8ff082bb859b8d4f17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758123956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002900/7a8aa2cc4274120447bf2f8ff082bb859b8d4f17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758123956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"descrip